    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should reach out but what's the point? it's like the person they all knew is already gone. even when i'm in a room with people, i feel invisible. it's like there's this massive gap between me and the rest of the world. like i'm just a glitch in the system that everyone collectively decided to ignore. how am i supposed to \"reach out\" to people who have already moved on like i never happened?",
